        "Content": "Exceptional Residential Development Opportunity\r\n\r\nMain Street, Howth Village – Full Planning Granted for 34 Apartments\r\nA rare opportunity to develop a prime residential site in the heart of Howth Village, with full planning permission secured for 34 architecturally designed apartment homes.\r\n\r\nLocated beside the public library on Main Street, this site offers the ultimate in convenient living in one of Dublin’s most desirable coastal settings. The design and layout are ideal for owner-occupiers seeking high-quality, energy-efficient homes.\r\n________________________________________\r\nKey Highlights\r\n•\t34 new 1, 2 & 3-bedroom apartments\r\n•\tTotal site area: c.2,938 m²\r\n•\tDesigned by award-winning architects Tyler Owens\r\no\tIncludes a period residence for 4 apartment homes\r\no\tFront-facing 2-storey block\r\no\tRear 3–4 storey block\r\n•\tGross floor area:\r\no\tTotal: 4,434 m²\r\no\tResidential: 2,702 m²\r\no\tAncillary uses (car park, plant, waste, etc.): 1,732 m²\r\n•\tGenerous open space: 690 m² (23.5% of site area)\r\n•\tExisting office buildings to be removed\r\n________________________________________\r\nStrong Demand for Owner-Occupier Homes\r\n\r\nNo new apartment developments for owner occupiers have been delivered in the area for over 20 years. Demand continues to rise for owner occupiers, making this a standout opportunity for a high-quality, well-located scheme. The village-centre site offers immediate access to shops, cafés, schools, coastal walks, local amenities, and the DART station.\r\n________________________________________\r\nFurther Information Available Upon Request\r\n•\tFull planning documents\r\n•\tLayout and design drawings\r\n•\tAccommodation schedule\r\n•\tEngineering and civil reports\r\n•\tHigh-quality CGIs showcasing the design\r\n________________________________________\r\n📞 Phone: +353 1 818 3000\r\n✉️ Email: conor@gallagherquigley.ie\r\n📍 Contact: Conor Gallagher, Gallagher Quigley Estate Agents\r\n________________________________________\r\nThis is a unique opportunity to deliver a landmark residential development in a high-demand location, enhancing the character of Howth Village while offering a new standard of living for owner-occupiers.\r\n\r\nApproximate apartment Schedule – 60 Main Street, Howth\r\n\r\nApartment No\tNo. of Bedrooms\tGross sq. m\r\nApartment 1\t2 bed\t                74.0\r\nApartment 2\t2 bed\t                78.0\r\nApartment 3\t1 bed\t                54.0\r\nApartment 4\t1 bed\t                54.0\r\nApartment 5\t2 bed\t                75.0\r\nApartment 6\t2 bed\t                81.0\r\nApartment 7\t1 bed\t                52.0\r\nApartment 8\t1 bed\t                52.0\r\nApartment 9\t2 bed\t                74.0\r\nApartment 10\t2 bed\t                74.0\r\nApartment 11\t2 bed\t                78.0\r\nApartment 12\t1 bed\t                54.0\r\nApartment 13\t1 bed\t                54.0\r\nApartment 14\t2 bed\t                75.0\r\nApartment 15\t2 bed\t                81.0\r\nApartment 16\t1 bed\t                52.0\r\nApartment 17\t1 bed\t                52.0\r\nApartment 18\t2 bed\t               74.0\r\nApartment 19\t2 bed\t               74.0\r\nApartment 20\t2 bed\t               78.0\r\nApartment 21\t1 bed\t               54.0\r\nApartment 22\t1 bed\t               54.0\r\nApartment 23\t2 bed\t               75.0\r\nApartment 24\t2 bed\t               81.0\r\nApartment 25\t1 bed\t               52.0\r\nApartment 26\t1 bed\t               52.0\r\nApartment 27\t2 bed\t               74.0\r\nApartment 28\t2 bed\t               90.0\r\nApartment 29\t2 bed\t               99.0\r\nApartment 30\t2 bed\t               89.0\r\nApartment 31\t2 bed\t               75.0\r\nApartment 32\t2 bed\t               75.5\r\nApartment 33\t2 bed\t               89.0\r\nApartment 34\t1 bed\t               47.0"
